# Intentionally empty of NEXT_PUBLIC_* values — testing whether Cloudflare
# Workers Builds can inject dashboard-configured variables at build time
# (a dedicated "Build variables" section, if one exists) instead of
# needing these committed here. If the build fails or ships a broken
# bundle, dashboard variables aren't reaching `next build` and this file
# needs the 3 NEXT_PUBLIC_* values restored (see other client branches).
#
# Secrets (SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, META_APP_SECRET, ENCRYPTION_KEY,
# WACRM_API_KEY) never belong in this file — configure them as Cloudflare
# Workers Secrets (runtime-only), regardless of how this test turns out.
